          "%md",
          "",
          "### Before You Start",
          "",
          "Steps 2 to 6 match the pattern `(src IS computer) -[e IS auth_connected]-> (dst IS computer)`. The edge links the source computer of an authentication to its destination computer. In the ground-truth graph, the `compromised` edge links a staging host to a victim."
        ],
