      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**Result:** `C17693` was active in 73 hours, and 30 of them reach 5 or more victims, in recurring clusters across the whole period. Its busiest hour, bucket 213, reached 43 victims. `C19932` and `C22409` never exceed 2 confirmed victims in any hour."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : null,
        "relations" : [],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "### Step 2: Burst Generalization",
          "",
          "Search the full cyber graph for computers that connect to 5 or more distinct computers within one hour. The search uses `auth_connected` edges, so it covers all authentication events, not only the labeled ones. The red team label does not filter the result. It only sorts the hourly buckets that contain a confirmed red team event to the top, as a reference.",
          "",
          "The unlabeled bursts follow, sorted by `distinct_targets_overall`, lowest first. A domain controller, file server, or backup job connects to hundreds of computers as normal behavior and clears the hourly threshold all the time; the ordering moves such always-busy hosts to the end. If `auth_connected` alone is too noisy, cross-check with `flows_connected` as a second signal."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : null,
        "relations" : [],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%sql",
          "",
          "WITH computer_edges AS (",
          "  SELECT *",
          "  FROM",
          "    GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "      lanl_cyber_graph",
          "      MATCH (src IS computer) -[e IS auth_connected]-> (dst IS computer)",
          "      COLUMNS (",
          "        src.computer AS staging_host,",
          "        dst.computer AS candidate_victim,",
          "        e.time       AS conn_time,",
          "        e.redteam    AS is_confirmed_redteam",
          "      )",
          "    )",
          "),",
          "host_baseline AS (",
          "  SELECT",
          "    staging_host,",
          "    COUNT(DISTINCT candidate_victim) AS distinct_targets_overall",
          "  FROM",
          "    computer_edges",
          "  GROUP BY",
          "    staging_host",
          "),",
          "bucketed AS (",
          "  SELECT",
          "    staging_host,",
          "    TRUNC(conn_time / 3600)          AS time_bucket,",
          "    COUNT(DISTINCT candidate_victim) AS distinct_targets_in_bucket,",
          "    MAX(is_confirmed_redteam)        AS bucket_has_confirmed_redteam_event",
          "  FROM",
          "    computer_edges",
          "  GROUP BY",
          "    staging_host,",
          "    TRUNC(conn_time / 3600)",
          ")",
          "SELECT",
          "  b.*,",
          "  hb.distinct_targets_overall",
          "FROM",
          "  bucketed b",
          "  JOIN host_baseline hb ON hb.staging_host = b.staging_host",
          "WHERE",
          "  distinct_targets_in_bucket >= 5   -- threshold: pivoting to 5+ distinct computers inside one hour",
          "ORDER BY",
          "  bucket_has_confirmed_redteam_event DESC,",
          "  distinct_targets_overall ASC,     -- de-prioritize hosts that are always busy, see Step 3a",
          "  distinct_targets_in_bucket DESC",
          "FETCH APPROX FIRST 100 ROWS ONLY;   -- limit to a manageable number of candidates for further investigation"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "table",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : false,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : null,
        "relations" : [],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**Result:** the hourly buckets with a confirmed red team event fill the first 57 rows, and they include all three staging hosts. `C17693` accounts for 42 of the 100 rows. `C19932` and `C22409` connect to up to 17 computers in an hour in the authentication data, although the red team labels count at most 2 victims per hour for them. The labels cover only part of their activity."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : null,
        "relations" : [],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "### Step 3: New Candidate Isolation",
          "",
          "Use the same shape as Step 2, but drop the known staging hosts from the ground truth and the hourly buckets that already contain a confirmed red team event. The remaining rows are unlabeled beachhead candidates, with the always-busy hosts last."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : null,
        "relations" : [],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%sql",
          "",
          "WITH computer_edges AS (",
          "  SELECT *",
          "  FROM",
          "    GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "      lanl_cyber_graph",
          "      MATCH (src IS computer) -[e IS auth_connected]-> (dst IS computer)",
          "      COLUMNS (",
          "        src.computer AS staging_host,",
          "        dst.computer AS candidate_victim,",
          "        e.time       AS conn_time,",
          "        e.redteam    AS is_confirmed_redteam",
          "      )",
          "    )",
          "),",
          "host_baseline AS (",
          "  SELECT",
          "    staging_host,",
          "    COUNT(DISTINCT candidate_victim) AS distinct_targets_overall",
          "  FROM",
          "    computer_edges",
          "  GROUP BY",
          "    staging_host",
          "),",
          "bucketed AS (",
          "  SELECT",
          "    staging_host,",
          "    TRUNC(conn_time / 3600)          AS time_bucket,",
          "    COUNT(DISTINCT candidate_victim) AS distinct_targets_in_bucket",
          "  FROM computer_edges",
          "  GROUP BY staging_host, TRUNC(conn_time / 3600)",
          "  HAVING MAX(is_confirmed_redteam) = 0     -- drop buckets that already contain a confirmed REDTEAM auth event",
          "     AND COUNT(DISTINCT candidate_victim) >= 5",
          ")",
          "SELECT",
          "  b.*,",
          "  hb.distinct_targets_overall",
          "FROM",
          "  bucketed b",
          "  JOIN host_baseline hb ON hb.staging_host = b.staging_host",
          "WHERE",
          "  b.staging_host NOT IN (",
          "    SELECT DISTINCT staging_host",
          "    FROM",
          "      GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "        lanl_ground_truth_graph",
          "        MATCH (src IS computer) -[c IS compromised]-> (dst IS computer)",
          "        COLUMNS (src.computer AS staging_host)",
          "      )",
          "  )",
          "ORDER BY",
          "  distinct_targets_overall ASC,          -- de-prioritize hosts that are always busy",
          "  distinct_targets_in_bucket DESC",
          "FETCH APPROX FIRST 100 ROWS ONLY;   -- limit to a manageable number of candidates for further investigation"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "table",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : false,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
