      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**Result:** the top candidates are hosts whose whole activity is one small burst: they connect to 5 or 6 computers in one hour and to at most 6 computers overall. The ordering by overall fan-out favors such one-off bursts. Review them as candidates, but expect many of them to be harmless."
        ],
